          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "他深受主人器重，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 5,
          "verse": 2,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "病得快要死了。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 8,
          "verse": 3,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "请他来治愈他的仆人。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 13,
          "verse": 5,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "又为我们建造了会堂。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 20,
          "verse": 6,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "我不配让您进我的屋子。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 22,
          "verse": 7,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "但只要您一句话，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 23,
          "verse": 7,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "我的仆人就会痊愈。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 24,
          "verse": 8,
          "content_chars": 14,
          "text": "8 因为我自己也是属上级权柄的人，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 41,
          "verse": 10,
          "content_chars": 20,
          "text": "__PERSON_F__ 使寡妇的儿子复活"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 42,
          "verse": 11,
          "content_chars": 2,
          "text": "11 不久，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 46,
          "verse": 12,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "有人抬着一具死人，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 47,
          "verse": 12,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "是一个寡妇的独生子，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 48,
          "verse": 12,
          "content_chars": 11,
          "text": "镇上很大的人群与她同行。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 57,
          "verse": 14,
          "content_chars": 2,
          "text": "他说："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 59,
          "verse": 14,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "我吩咐你，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 63,
          "verse": 15,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "开始说话，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 68,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 12,
          "text": "“我们中间兴起了一位大先知，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 69,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 23,
          "text": "__MOST_HIGH_A__ 来帮助他的百姓了。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 76,
          "verse": 19,
          "content_chars": 3,
          "text": "问他说："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 78,
          "verse": 19,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "还是我们还要等候别人？"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 82,
          "verse": 20,
          "content_chars": 23,
          "text": "“施洗约翰 __PERSON_C__ 打发我们来问你："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 87,
          "verse": 21,
          "content_chars": 27,
          "text": "__PERSON_F__ 治好了许多有疾病、残疾和恶灵的人，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 92,
          "verse": 22,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "盲人看见了，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 96,
          "verse": 22,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "死人复活了，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 101,
          "verse": 24,
          "content_chars": 32,
          "text": "__PERSON_F__ 就开始向众人谈论 __PERSON_C__ ："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 102,
          "verse": 24,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "“你们去旷野是要看什么？"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 108,
          "verse": 25,
          "content_chars": 19,
          "text": "那些穿华丽衣服、过奢侈生活的人都在王宫里。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 113,
          "verse": 26,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "他不只是个先知。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 117,
          "verse": 27,
          "content_chars": 1,
          "text": "’[b]"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 120,
          "verse": 28,
          "content_chars": 18,
          "text": "没有比 __PERSON_C__ 更大的；"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 123,
          "verse": 29,
          "content_chars": 22,
          "text": "29 (众人甚至税吏听 __PERSON_F__ 说的话，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 130,
          "verse": 31,
          "content_chars": 2,
          "text": "“那么，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 131,
          "verse": 31,
          "content_chars": 11,
          "text": "这世代的人该比作什么呢？"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 132,
          "verse": 31,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "他们像什么呢？"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 134,
          "verse": 32,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "互相呼叫说："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 136,
          "verse": 32,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "你们却不跳舞；"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 138,
          "verse": 32,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "你们却不哭泣。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 142,
          "verse": 34,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "34 人子来了，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 146,
          "verse": 34,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "是税吏和罪人的朋友。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 149,
          "verse": 35,
          "content_chars": 19,
          "text": "”  \n\n罪恶的女人膏抹 __PERSON_F__"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 150,
          "verse": 36,
          "content_chars": 22,
          "text": "36 有一位法利赛人请 __PERSON_F__ 吃饭，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 151,
          "verse": 36,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "他进了法利赛人的家，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 152,
          "verse": 36,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "在席上坐下。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 153,
          "verse": 37,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "37 那城有一个行淫的女人，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 156,
          "verse": 38,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "38 她站在他背后，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 161,
          "verse": 38,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "倾倒香膏在脚上。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 165,
          "verse": 39,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "“若这人是先知，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 167,
          "verse": 39,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "是个罪人。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 169,
          "verse": 40,
          "content_chars": 15,
          "text": "40 __PERSON_F__ 对他说："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 170,
          "verse": 40,
          "content_chars": 2,
          "text": "“西门，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 171,
          "verse": 40,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "我有话要告诉你。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 172,
          "verse": 40,
          "content_chars": 2,
          "text": "”  \n\n“请说，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 173,
          "verse": 40,
          "content_chars": 2,
          "text": "老师，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 180,
          "verse": 42,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "债主就免了他们的债。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 184,
          "verse": 43,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "43 西门回答说："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 193,
          "verse": 44,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "你没有给我水洗脚，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 195,
          "verse": 44,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "又用头发擦干。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 196,
          "verse": 45,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "45 你没有给我亲嘴，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 201,
          "verse": 47,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "她许多的罪都赦免了，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 202,
          "verse": 47,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "因为她爱得多；"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 204,
          "verse": 47,
          "content_chars": 3,
          "text": "爱也少。"
        }
